+            /* File layout (ModelRoData_BSPRecord_file, verified 32-bit):
+             *   coord3d Point, coord3d Vector, u32 leftChild, u32 rightChild,
+             *   s16 reserved, u16 RwDataIndex.
+             * leftChild/rightChild are node offsets -- patched in the link pass, the same
+             * way GROUP's ChildGroup is. */
